@startuml client-server-boundary
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundCorner 8

title Arquitectura Cliente-Servidor y Frontera de Microservicio - ASII-24 Semana 5

package "Capa Clientes (Consumidores)" #EBF3FB {
    component [Portal Web SHI\n(SPA Vue/React/Blade)] as WebClient
    component [App Movil Personal Clinico\n(Android / iOS)] as MobileClient
    component [Sistemas Externos / Postman] as PostmanClient
}

package "Puerta de Enlace / API Gateway" #F3E5F5 {
    component [Reverse Proxy / Gateway] as Gateway
    note right of Gateway
      - Terminacion TLS/HTTPS
      - Validacion X-Tenant-ID obligatorio
      - Enrutamiento de peticiones
    end note
}

package "Frontera Logica del Modulo ASII-24" #E8F5E9 {
    component [API Rest Controller\n/api/v1/api-contracts] as ApiController
    component [Servicio de Autenticacion JWT\n(Middleware Auth)] as JwtAuth
    component [Capa de Aplicacion ASII-24\n(Casos de Uso)] as AppService
    component [Dominio y Validacion OpenAPI] as DomainCore
    interface "ApiContractRepository" as RepoPort
    component [Adaptador PostgreSQL / SQLite] as RepoAdapter
}

database "Persistencia Central ASII-24\n(PostgreSQL / JSONB)" as Database

WebClient --> Gateway : HTTPS / JSON
MobileClient --> Gateway : HTTPS / JSON
PostmanClient --> Gateway : HTTPS / JSON

Gateway --> JwtAuth : Valida Bearer Token
JwtAuth --> ApiController : Peticion Autenticada

ApiController --> AppService : DTOs de Entrada
AppService --> DomainCore : Validacion de Reglas
AppService --> RepoPort : Persistir / Consultar
RepoPort <|.. RepoAdapter : Implementa
RepoAdapter --> Database : SQL / Prepared Statements

note bottom of DomainCore
  Frontera Autonoma:
  - Validacion estructural OpenAPI
  - Calculo de Checksum SHA-256
  - Inmutabilidad de versiones
end note

@enduml
